3
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:23,279
Welcome to the Seychelles.

4
00:00:23,279 --> 00:00:29,359
115 islands scattered across the Indian
Ocean like emeralds on blue velvet. This

5
00:00:29,359 --> 00:00:37,200
isn't just paradise. This is where the
