changed it. And today, you're coming

6
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:47,200
with us. 1,000 m from anywhere. That's the
Seychelles. A drift in the heart of the
Indian Ocean. These islands exist in

7
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:55,280
